        "title": "Missing proper handling of RSA-PSS keys and RSA-PSS signatures for ASN1_sign/verify()",
        "body": "The RSA-PSS keys should not allow producing regular PKCS#1 v1.5 signatures at all.\r\n\r\nReproducer:\r\n```\r\nopenssl genpkey -algorithm RSA-PSS -out testrsapss.pem -pkeyopt rsa_keygen_bits:2048\r\nopenssl req -new -key testrsapss.pem -out request.pem\r\nopenssl req -in request.pem -text -noout\r\nCertificate Request:\r\n    Data:\r\n        Version: 1 (0x0)\r\n        Subject: C = AU, ST = Some-State, O = Internet Widgits Pty Ltd\r\n        Subject Public Key Info:\r\n            Public Key Algorithm: rsassaPss\r\n                RSA-PSS Public-Key: (2048 bit)\r\n                Modulus:\r\n                    00:ce:cf:79:ad:11:f8:f5:fe:73:67:51:bd:09:bf:\r\n                    c8:7b:93:f9:19:f3:6d:a3:67:ad:bb:62:fd:d2:aa:\r\n                    de:c0:e2:4a:67:80:90:e3:d0:fc:40:42:b3:8e:71:\r\n                    49:85:a8:23:fe:2e:4c:35:d5:87:79:30:ab:0c:0b:\r\n                    10:8e:b6:ca:4b:a8:a4:fc:76:35:d7:28:81:d3:06:\r\n                    78:22:d5:ec:7c:c4:17:fa:a2:15:a7:65:fd:05:01:\r\n                    71:fc:80:f9:9d:50:97:ad:07:1f:31:f7:2a:16:4d:\r\n                    7d:72:fe:0d:9a:02:a0:75:e1:19:4f:d3:b9:6d:a4:\r\n                    97:da:32:8a:b1:1f:04:ff:8f:90:8a:52:3d:c4:1c:\r\n                    73:8a:0f:87:27:67:06:d9:c9:4c:90:66:6e:b7:98:\r\n                    62:07:0c:16:67:4f:b5:bf:5b:f9:65:b9:14:1b:0a:\r\n                    e8:18:9a:81:b2:ac:c8:f2:f4:d6:f9:b4:ff:55:59:\r\n                    61:0a:07:68:02:3e:bf:a7:9e:37:b6:00:4c:e3:7f:\r\n                    4e:d5:90:c3:23:15:59:6d:a7:48:b9:a7:30:4b:05:\r\n                    76:c8:19:52:cc:31:84:c4:9c:23:8a:c0:01:c0:e6:\r\n                    56:36:d6:b8:95:0e:4d:23:56:44:cc:0d:08:d7:e3:\r\n                    0f:cb:2c:ef:5f:4f:f5:66:ea:60:0e:d7:2a:4f:9c:\r\n                    d6:53\r\n                Exponent: 65537 (0x10001)\r\n                No PSS parameter restrictions\r\n        Attributes:\r\n            a0:00\r\n    Signature Algorithm: sha256WithRSAEncryption\r\n         b9:95:98:b8:7d:f7:37:85:85:aa:8d:2b:83:87:d7:c1:7e:f6:\r\n         09:e4:1a:8b:76:c9:a6:e6:b1:ca:89:b1:79:b3:83:ff:1c:39:\r\n         8d:63:ce:77:1a:b6:72:d1:de:73:7b:d8:d8:12:a6:6f:72:97:\r\n         6a:5b:2a:78:21:24:04:be:ba:4f:21:1a:a0:62:37:45:96:81:\r\n         86:dc:2e:15:98:97:fe:80:9f:d9:b3:1c:38:fe:21:a0:79:4e:\r\n         d7:d1:4e:be:10:6e:dc:38:9e:2e:29:c4:e2:f0:69:de:78:65:\r\n         be:e4:dc:22:70:ba:9a:56:0f:47:56:db:71:5d:47:a1:9a:00:\r\n         d5:93:00:54:88:6d:42:d7:5e:e5:44:fa:46:ba:73:8a:23:90:\r\n         34:ff:60:d7:41:4d:61:a1:e8:9f:4e:4d:08:79:a1:18:ac:02:\r\n         c1:db:fb:01:00:73:f4:c1:e6:9e:89:5f:ca:77:9a:f1:36:0a:\r\n         d4:6e:92:8b:14:f0:cd:68:54:32:ac:9a:3f:94:b8:4a:dc:08:\r\n         ac:62:60:f2:a4:79:35:5b:14:3b:80:cd:34:b9:cf:19:d2:bf:\r\n         b3:6f:91:77:6e:16:56:75:f5:b8:fc:bf:97:00:a5:60:4c:42:\r\n         b3:a2:f0:be:36:95:58:9c:02:8a:d3:ba:35:52:d5:7c:db:06:\r\n```",
